description:
The structs are given. Write the functions in `solution.c`:

```c
struct point { double x; double y; };
struct rect { struct point corner; double width; double height; };   /* corner is the bottom left */

double area(struct rect r);
bool contains(struct rect r, struct point p);           /* edges count as inside */
void scale(struct rect *r, double factor);              /* width and height times factor, corner stays */
bool overlaps(const struct rect *a, const struct rect *b);
        /* true if they share some area; only touching edges does not count */
struct rect bounding_box(const struct point *points, size_t count);   /* the smallest rect around
                                                                         all the points; count >= 1 */
```

